msgstr "tipo"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:511
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "table"
msgstr "tavolo"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Connect Window"
msgstr "Collegare la finestra"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Sign in from the Connect window, which appears both on its own screen and on"
" every public page. It carries the whole flow: pick a nickname, register a "
"new one or enter a password for a registered one, and choose whether to "
"remember the terminal. A remembered terminal signs you in with a single "
"click, and one set to auto-login takes you straight to the chat."
msgstr ""
"Accedi dalla finestra Connect, che appare sia sul proprio schermo che su "
"ogni pagina pubblica. Porta l'intero flusso: scegli un soprannome, registra "
"un nuovo o inserisci una password per una registrata e scegli se ricordare "
"il terminale. Un terminale ricordato ti firma con un solo clic, e un set per"
" auto-login ti porta dritto alla chat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:577
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Clickable nicknames, channels, and URLs, with hover cards and a preview card"
" under any message carrying a link."
msgstr ""
"Soprannomi, canali e URL cliccabili, con carte hover e una scheda di "
"anteprima sotto qualsiasi messaggio che trasporta un link."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:61
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics.ex:91
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1726
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1749
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1769
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1770
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Retro Games"
msgstr "Giochi retro"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1772
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "retro games"
msgstr "giochi retro"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1834
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hex Boxing is also available."
msgstr "Hex Boxing è disponibile anche."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1914
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It is also available in Retro Games solo mode against an AI tank."
msgstr ""
"È disponibile anche nella modalità solitaria dei Giochi retro contro un "
"carro IA."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1835
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pixel Tanks is also available."
msgstr "Pixel Tanks è disponibile anche."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3102
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Play classic point & click adventures in your browser — "
msgstr "Gioca ad avventure punta e clicca classiche nel browser — "

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2947
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2980
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3050
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Powered by"
msgstr "Basato su"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2846
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3106
